noi_dung:
Cho $a,b>0$. Chứng minh rằng:

a) $\dfrac{1}{ab}\ge\dfrac{4}{(a+b)^2}$;

b) $\dfrac{1}{a}+\dfrac{1}{b}\ge\dfrac{4}{a+b}$;

c) $\dfrac{1}{a^2+b^2}+\dfrac{1}{ab}\ge\dfrac{6}{(a+b)^2}$.

